<section class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Dein Überblick</p><h1>Willkommen, {{emojify data.login.user}}</h1><p>Hier siehst du den Zustand deiner verbundenen Dienste und findest direkte nächste Schritte.</p></section>
<section class="metric-grid"><article class="metric"><strong>{{data.current.length}}</strong><span>verbundene Dienste</span></article><article class="metric"><strong>{{data.video_count}}</strong><span>Videos</span></article><article class="metric"><strong>{{data.playlist_count}}</strong><span>Playlists</span></article><article class="metric"><strong>{{data.member_count}}</strong><span>Community-Mitglieder</span></article></section>
<section class="card"><div class="section-title"><h2>Verbindungen</h2><span class="muted">OAuth-Status</span></div>{{#if data.current.length}}<div class="connection-list">{{#each data.current}}<div class="connection"><span class="service-{{service}}">{{service}}</span><strong>{{emojify name}}</strong><span class="status ok">Verbunden</span></div>{{/each}}</div>{{else}}<div class="empty-state"><h3>Noch kein Dienst verbunden</h3><p>Verbinde eine Plattform, damit SimpleYTH deine Inhalte anzeigen kann.</p></div>{{/if}}<div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/auth/youtube">YouTube verbinden</a><a class="button" href="/auth/twitch">Twitch verbinden</a><a class="button" href="/auth/discord">Discord verbinden</a></div></section>
<section class="feature-grid"><a class="card link-card" href="/Videos"><h2>Content-Hub</h2><p>Videos, Playlists und Kanäle durchsuchen.</p></a><a class="card link-card" href="/Analytics"><h2>Analytics</h2><p>Aktuelle Kennzahlen und Trends ansehen.</p></a><a class="card link-card" href="/Api"><h2>Developer API</h2><p>Keys erstellen und API integrieren.</p></a></section>